The top 50 accounts with most followers on the photo- and video-sharing social platform [[Instagram]] are as follows, with each total rounded down to the nearest million followers.<ref>{{Cite web |title=Most Followed Instagram Accounts in the World in 2024 |url=https://notcommon.com/most-followed/instagram |access-date=2024-06-09 |website=notcommon.com |language=en}}</ref> The most-followed account on the platform is Instagram's own brand account. The most followed person is the Portuguese footballer [[Cristiano Ronaldo]], and the most followed woman is the American singer-actress [[Selena Gomez]].

== List ==
[[File:Cristiano Ronaldo in 2023.jpg|thumb|150px|right|[[Cristiano Ronaldo]] is the most-followed individual, sportsperson, and European on Instagram, with over 638 million followers.]]
[[File:Lionel-Messi-Argentina-2022-FIFA-World-Cup (cropped).jpg|thumb|150px|right|[[Lionel Messi]] is the most-followed South American on Instagram, with over 504 million followers.]]
[[File:191125 Selena Gomez at the 2019 American Music Awards.png|thumb|150px|right|[[Selena Gomez]] is the most-followed woman, actor, singer, and North American on Instagram, with over 424 million followers.]]
[[File:Virat Kohli in PMO New Delhi.jpg|thumb|150px|right|[[Virat Kohli]] is the most-followed Asian on Instagram, with over 270 million followers.]]
[[File:Official portrait of Narendra Modi 2022.jpg|thumb|150px|right|[[Narendra Modi]] is the most-followed politician on Instagram, with over 91.2 million followers.]]

